// Title: Unusual Parent Process For Cmd.EXE
// Rule ID: 4b991083-3d0e-44ce-8fc4-b254025d8d4b
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_cmd_unusual_parent.yml
